                : Filter((f.browser = "Firefox"))
                :   GetProperty(f.browser) [node:Person]
                :     Argument(f)
                StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(p) out=(p, f, m)
                  : Expand((f)-[_r1:POSTED]->(m:Post))
                  :   Expand((p)-[_r0:KNOWS]-(f:Person))
                  :     Argument(p)
                  StoreQuery[leveldb] out=(p)
                    : Filter((p.first_name = "Jun"))
                    :   GetProperty(p.first_name) [node:Person]
                    :     EntityScan(p:Person)

## SNB2 — A whole-path condition on reply chains: how the cost of extracting paths grows with scale
traits: start=filtered scan hops=1..4 fan-out=low variable-length aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: c.creation_date | R4 path: x.length | R6 aggregate / sort: root.comment_id

### SNB2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(root.comment_id, replies)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[replies DESC, root.comment_id ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: root.comment_id | count(*) AS replies]
  :       GetProperty(root.comment_id) [node:Comment]
  :         Filter((root.length >= 50))
  :           GetProperty(root.length) [node:Comment]
  :             VarLengthExpand((c)-[_r0:REPLY_TO_COMMENT*1..4]->(root:Comment)) seg[all(x IN nodes WHERE (x.length >= 50))]
  :               Filter((c.length >= 50))
  :                 GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
  :                   Filter((c.creation_date >= "2012-12-01"))
  :                     GetProperty(c.creation_date) [node:Comment]
  :                       EntityScan(c:Comment)

### SNB2 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[replies DESC, root.comment_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: root.comment_id | count(*) AS replies]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(root) out=(root, root.comment_id)
        : GetProperty(root.comment_id) [node:Comment]
        :   Filter((root.length >= 50))
        :     GetProperty(root.length) [node:Comment]
        :       Argument(root)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE (x.length >= 50)))
          ListFetch[mysql] _seg__r0.nodes.length from _seg__r0 [elem:Comment]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, _seg__r0, root)
              : VarLengthExpand((c)-[_r0:REPLY_TO_COMMENT*1..4]->(root:Comment)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.length >= 50))
                :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
                :     Filter((c.creation_date >= "2012-12-01"))
                :       GetProperty(c.creation_date) [node:Comment]
                :         EntityScan(c:Comment)

### SNB2 @document
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[replies DESC, root.comment_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: root.comment_id | count(*) AS replies]
      StoreQuery[mongo] in=(root) out=(root, root.comment_id)
        : GetProperty(root.comment_id) [node:Comment]
        :   Filter((root.length >= 50))
        :     GetProperty(root.length) [node:Comment]
        :       Argument(root)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE (x.length >= 50)))
          ListFetch[mongo] _seg__r0.nodes.length from _seg__r0 [elem:Comment]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, _seg__r0, root)
              : VarLengthExpand((c)-[_r0:REPLY_TO_COMMENT*1..4]->(root:Comment)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[mongo] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.length >= 50))
                :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
                :     Filter((c.creation_date >= "2012-12-01"))
                :       GetProperty(c.creation_date) [node:Comment]
                :         EntityScan(c:Comment)

### SNB2 @columnar
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[replies DESC, root.comment_id ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: root.comment_id | count(*) AS replies]
      StoreQuery[clickhouse] in=(root) out=(root, root.comment_id)
        : GetProperty(root.comment_id) [node:Comment]
        :   Filter((root.length >= 50))
        :     GetProperty(root.length) [node:Comment]
        :       Argument(root)
        Coord Filter(all(x IN nodes(_seg__r0) WHERE (x.length >= 50)))
          ListFetch[clickhouse] _seg__r0.nodes.length from _seg__r0 [elem:Comment]
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(c) out=(c, _seg__r0, root)
              : VarLengthExpand((c)-[_r0:REPLY_TO_COMMENT*1..4]->(root:Comment)) emit _seg__r0
              :   Argument(c)
              StoreQuery[clickhouse] out=(c)
                : Filter((c.length >= 50))
                :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
                :     Filter((c.creation_date >= "2012-12-01"))
                :       GetProperty(c.creation_date) [node:Comment]
                :         EntityScan(c:Comment)

