## SNB3 — Two hops plus an aggregation: where to place the end condition and the aggregated value, across scales
traits: start=filtered scan hops=2 fan-out=medium aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: fo.creation_date | R2 end: c.length | R6 aggregate / sort: fo.title, m.length

### SNB3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(fo.title, comments, avgPostLength)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[comments DESC, fo.title ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: fo.title | count(*) AS comments, avg(m.length) AS avgPostLength]
  :       GetProperty(m.length) [node:Post]
  :         GetProperty(fo.title) [node:Forum]
  :           Filter((c.length >= 100))
  :             GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
  :               Expand((m)<-[_r1:REPLY_TO_POST]-(c:Comment))
  :                 Expand((fo)<-[_r0:IN_FORUM]-(m:Post))
  :                   Filter((fo.creation_date >= "2012-11-01"))
  :                     GetProperty(fo.creation_date) [node:Forum]
  :                       EntityScan(fo:Forum)

### SNB3 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[comments DESC, fo.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: fo.title | count(*) AS comments, avg(m.length) AS avgPostLength]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(m) out=(m, m.length)
        : GetProperty(m.length) [node:Post]
        :   Argument(m)
        Fetch[mysql] in=(fo) out=(fo, fo.title)
          : GetProperty(fo.title) [node:Forum]
          :   Argument(fo)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(c) out=(c)
            : Filter((c.length >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
            :     Argument(c)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(fo) out=(fo, c, m)
              : Expand((m)<-[_r1:REPLY_TO_POST]-(c:Comment))
              :   Expand((fo)<-[_r0:IN_FORUM]-(m:Post))
              :     Argument(fo)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(fo)
                : Filter((fo.creation_date >= "2012-11-01"))
                :   GetProperty(fo.creation_date) [node:Forum]
                :     EntityScan(fo:Forum)

### SNB3 @document
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[comments DESC, fo.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: fo.title | count(*) AS comments, avg(m.length) AS avgPostLength]
      Fetch[mongo] in=(m) out=(m, m.length)
        : GetProperty(m.length) [node:Post]
        :   Argument(m)
        Fetch[mongo] in=(fo) out=(fo, fo.title)
          : GetProperty(fo.title) [node:Forum]
          :   Argument(fo)
          StoreQuery[mongo] in=(c) out=(c)
            : Filter((c.length >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
            :     Argument(c)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(fo) out=(fo, c, m)
              : Expand((m)<-[_r1:REPLY_TO_POST]-(c:Comment))
              :   Expand((fo)<-[_r0:IN_FORUM]-(m:Post))
              :     Argument(fo)
              StoreQuery[mongo] out=(fo)
                : Filter((fo.creation_date >= "2012-11-01"))
                :   GetProperty(fo.creation_date) [node:Forum]
                :     EntityScan(fo:Forum)

### SNB3 @columnar
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[comments DESC, fo.title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: fo.title | count(*) AS comments, avg(m.length) AS avgPostLength]
      Fetch[clickhouse] in=(m) out=(m, m.length)
        : GetProperty(m.length) [node:Post]
        :   Argument(m)
        Fetch[clickhouse] in=(fo) out=(fo, fo.title)
          : GetProperty(fo.title) [node:Forum]
          :   Argument(fo)
          StoreQuery[clickhouse] in=(c) out=(c)
            : Filter((c.length >= 100))
            :   GetProperty(c.length) [node:Comment]
            :     Argument(c)
